ltr"><span>The updated dependencies in package.json file of backend will lo=
ok like:</span></p><pre><span>"dependencies": {</span><br><span>    "cors":=
 "^2.8.5",</span><br><span>    "express": "^4.18.2",</span><br><span>    "s=
ocket.io": "^4.7.4"</span><br><span>}</span></pre><p dir=3D"ltr"><b><strong=
